  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Namibia. The main outcome areas it contributes to are equality and workers rights. The main rights holders are all workers employed in the various job categories under metal and allied industries. Through trainings, distribution of education information, mobilising and social dialogues the project aims to achieve progressive development within the outcome areas.</narrative>
  </description>
